{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>活到老學到老，網上有人發現最近一個有趣教韓文頻道，十分好看！韓文女老師邊教書邊派福利，貼身衫包不住豐滿上圍！網友紛紛表示：「老師教的真好」。</p>\n<h2>韓語老師用心教學 累積超過23萬名訂閱</h2>\n<p>有網友發現是一個名為「Nostaljia Green」來自韓國的YouTuber，她持續與丈夫共同推出《Mr. and Mrs. Green’s Free Korean Class》免費韓文課程，透過生活化情境與白板講解為初學者提供指導。目前頻道已累積超過23萬名訂閱者，她亦沒有因為爆紅而改變創作方向，繼續專注於分享繪畫創作以及一家三口溫馨互動。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647270497770_7773346536af824e6d3c32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-892-010-YouTube-2’22”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647270497770_7773346536af824e6d3c32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網友發現是一個名為「Nostaljia Green」來自韓國的YouTuber，推出免費韓文課程。（圖片來源：Nostaljia Green@YouTube）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727249579374_10758920246af824e8e578d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-892Beginner2-045123-YouTube-4’11”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727249579374_10758920246af824e8e578d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網友紛紛表示：「老師教的真好」。（圖片來源：Nostaljia Green@YouTube）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>韓語老師沖繩沙灘大解放 展現震撼上圍</h2>\n<p>華語圈也有不少觀眾將其影片搬運並翻譯至 Bilibili 分享，其中一條於日本沖繩拍攝性感影片引發網民關注。畫面中，Nostaljia Green身穿極度惹火比堅尼在沙灘上執行任務，貼身泳衣完全包不住她無比豐滿上圍。整個誘惑畫面全由她丈夫Mr. Green親手掌鏡拍攝，完美捕捉妻子震撼全場魔鬼身材，強烈視覺衝擊！</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727526998891_4738019816af824eba7db3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727526998891_4738019816af824eba7db3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>畫面中，Nostaljia Green身穿極度惹火比堅尼在沙灘上執行任務，貼身泳衣完全包不住她無比豐滿上圍。（圖片來源：Bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>感情狀況曝光 鏡頭記錄幸福婚姻</h2>\n<p>女老師咁正，可惜名花有主，她本身已婚並育有一女，平時熱愛攝影及手工藝創作，更會將親手繪製畫作公開販售。除了語言教學外，她亦熱衷於發掘韓國冷門景點與百年村落，甚至曾經遠赴台灣南部小鎮拍攝深度旅行紀錄。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚寶藏頻道 極度羨慕佢老公</h2>\n<p>大批網民看完教學影片後反應極度熱烈。許多人直呼這是一個罕見「寶藏頻道」，紛紛留言表示「老師教的真好」、「這種優質教學頻道，我都是開靜音學習，避免聲音干擾~」，甚至有人笑稱「忽然對學韓語產生興趣」。對於由丈夫親自拍攝惹火比堅尼畫面，大量男網民徹底崩潰並留言大讚「好羨慕老公」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647275978278_3624898526af824ec4af71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794647275978278_3624898526af824ec4af71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>貼身泳衣完全包不住她無比豐滿上圍。（圖片來源：Bilibili）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727775198756_2514768716af824ef0771b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464727775198756_2514768716af824ef0771b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>女老師咁正，可惜名花有主，她本身已婚並育有一女。（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728253541123_16124389736af824f3199e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728253541123_16124389736af824f3199e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網上有人發現最近一個有趣教韓文頻道，十分好看！（圖片來源：threads圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728385753060_1967255036af824f46e5d6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464728385753060_1967255036af824f46e5d6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>女老師咁正，可惜名花有主，她本身已婚並育有一女（圖片來源：Nostaljia Green@YouTube）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.139964+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1288,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:08:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:25.781239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:13.787986+00:00","content_hash":"6abdcf3c69e367efb821c721da33108923d94157e2c5a120b8aa0484f4943e88","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}